# Email autopilot (approved)

Niketh wants partnership Gmail replies handled **automatically** by the agent.

## PAUSE CHECK (run first)

If `outreach/BROWSER-AUTOMATION-PAUSED.json` has `"paused": true`, **do not** run any Kimi script, open Gmail, or open Gradlify in the browser. Niketh asked to stop continuous tab opening.

## When to run (no permission needed)

Only when pause file is absent or `"paused": false`:

```bash
python3 scripts/gradlify-email-agent.py --send --limit 10
```

If Kimi is down or `OPENAI_API_KEY` missing, say so once and use dry-run when key exists:

```bash
python3 scripts/gradlify-email-agent.py --limit 10
```

## After each run

- Brief summary: how many sent / skipped / errors
- Point to `outreach/email-agent-log.jsonl` for full audit
- Do not draft duplicate manual replies for threads the agent already handled

## Never auto-reply

- Sutton 11 Plus
- Non-partnership spam (agent search is partner-focused)
- Threads agent logged as SKIP
